2026-07-27T15:55:50,local,Full context (original),Gemini,answered,Hi I am unable to get enquiries from zoopla,"Hi there! I can certainly help you look into why your Zoopla enquiries aren't coming through. 

If you haven't tried already, you can attempt to manually pull those leads into the system to see if they appear. 

### Try Fetching Manually
1. Go to **Enquiry Base → Enquiry Base** in your left-hand menu.
2. Click the **Fetch Enquiries** button in the top right.
3. Select **Zoopla** (or the specific Zoopla phone source) from the **Source** dropdown.
4. Click **SUBMIT**.

If you have already tried this and it's returning nothing, or if your automated daily feed has stopped working, it is likely a portal connection or feed integration issue. Because feed issues require back-end technical adjustments, we'll need to get our support team involved.

Have you already tried using the manual **Fetch Enquiries** button, or would you like me to hand this over to your Account Manager right away to get the feed checked?",,
