2026-07-28T17:29:52,local,Smart retrieval (RAG),Groq,answered,It says I don t have SMS credit,"If you're seeing a message saying you don't have enough SMS credits, it's likely because your agency's SMS credit balance is low or depleted. You'll need to top up your SMS credits to send SMS communications from the Enquiry screen. 

Would you like to know how to check your current SMS credit balance or how to purchase more credits?",3461,83,,
2026-07-28T17:30:16,local,Smart retrieval (RAG),Groq,answered,yes please,"To check your current SMS credit balance, you'll need to head to the **Settings → Billing** section. From there, you should be able to see your current balance and any usage history.

As for purchasing more credits, you can usually do this from the same **Settings → Billing** area. You might need to click on a **Top-up** or **Buy credits** button to add more credits to your account.

If you're unsure or can't find the right section, I can try to guide you through it or point you in the direction of someone who can help. Would you like me to walk you through the steps or get in touch with your account manager?",2618,154,,
